# Two Maps reach the call of get(), one that holds whole numbers and one that holds texts: what one of them holds says nothing of what the receiver of this call holds, so the read is not typed by it.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# REQUIRES: entries-of-bun
# CHECK: CallInline {{*}} inlineBuiltin=MapGet
# CHECK-NOT: kind=ProvenContents subjectKind=Operation type=i32
